{title: There Is None like You (FJ_76_en)}
{song_number: 76}
{language: en}
{tempo: 62}

{comment: Chorus}
[G]There is none like [D]You, [C]no one else can touch my heart like You [G]do;
[Am7]I could search for all [D]eternity long and find: [G]there is none like You!
[Em][C]Your mercy flows like a [D7sus4]river [G]wide,
[Am7]and healing comes from Your [D]hands.
[G]Suffering children are [C]safe in Your arms; [D]there is none like [G]You.
